<title>UK: DSL sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</title>
<headline>DSL sets 400 million Danish crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager Generale Bank Brussels.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BONN</p>
<p> AMT    400 MLN DKK   COUPON    *5.0 PCT   MATURITY    29.DEC.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.735   PAY DATE    L=</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	  5.51 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES    *FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS AND 7.25 PCT YEARS THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	     L=LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 10-50     SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA (1)</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
